>skos:Concept</span></span>
<span id="cb53-7"><a href="#cb53-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">                rdf:about=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00007&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb53-8"><a href="#cb53-8" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span></span>
<span id="cb53-9"><a href="#cb53-9" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">                    xml:lang=</span><span class="st">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb53-10"><a href="#cb53-10" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                    Production</span>
<span id="cb53-11"><a href="#cb53-11" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;/<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb53-12"><a href="#cb53-12" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span></span>
<span id="cb53-13"><a href="#cb53-13" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">                    xml:lang=</span><span class="st">&quot;de&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb53-14"><a href="#cb53-14" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                    Herstellung</span>
<span id="cb53-15"><a href="#cb53-15" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;/<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb53-16"><a href="#cb53-16" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>            &lt;/<span class="kw">skos:Concept</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb53-17"><a href="#cb53-17" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>         &lt;/<span class="kw">lido:eventType</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb53-18"><a href="#cb53-18" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    &lt;<span class="kw">lido:event</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb53-19"><a href="#cb53-19" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;/<span class="kw">lido:eventSet</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>
            <h3 data-number="5.4.10" id="politicalentity"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.4.10</span> <span
            class="citation"
            data-cites="politicalEntity">@politicalEntity</span></h3>
            <p><strong>Attribute name:</strong> <a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#politicalEntity">lido:politicalEntity</a></p>
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> Attribute for &lt;<a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#partOfPlace">lido:partOfPlace</a>&gt;,
            &lt;<a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#place">lido:place</a>&gt;,
            &lt;<a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#repositoryLocation">lido:repositoryLocation</a>&gt;,
            and &lt;<a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#vitalPlaceActor">lido:vitalPlaceActor</a>&gt;
            to indicate the kind of place as an administrative,
            political entity. This attribute was intended in LIDO v1.0
            to qualify the type of the given place entity according to
            political structures, including values such as
            <em>country</em> or <em>city</em>. In LIDO v1.1 these values
            can be expressed in greater detail through &lt;<a
            href="https://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#placeClassification">lido:placeClassification</a>&gt;.
            Note that Place Classification in LIDO corresponds to ‘<a
            href="https://www.getty.edu/research/tools/vocabularies/guidelines/tgn_3_6_place_types.html">Place
            Type</a>’ in the <a
            href="https://www.getty.edu/research/tools/vocabularies/tgn/index.html">Getty
            Thesaurus of Geographic Names</a>. It is recommended to use
            a URI to refer to the kind of political entity.</p>
            <p><strong>Example:</strong> The following XML code snippet
            shows the index entry for “<a
            href="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q142">France</a>”,
            qualified as a “<a
            href="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q6256">country</a>” by
            the value for the political entity attribute.</p>
            <div class="sourceCode" id="cb54"><pre
            class="sourceCode xml"><code class="sourceCode xml"><span id="cb54-1"><a href="#cb54-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;<span class="kw">lido:partOfPlace</span></span>
<span id="cb54-2"><a href="#cb54-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">   lido:politicalEntity=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q6256&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb54-3"><a href="#cb54-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>   &lt;<span class="kw">lido:placeID</span></span>
<span id="cb54-4"><a href="#cb54-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">       lido:type=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00099&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb54-5"><a href="#cb54-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>       http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q20861</span>
<span id="cb54-6"><a href="#cb54-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>   &lt;/<span class="kw">lido:placeID</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb54-7"><a href="#cb54-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;/<span class="kw">lido:partOfPlace</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>
            <blockquote>
            <p>For more information, see the note for ‘<a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/documents/terminology-recommendation.html#politicalEntity">politicalEntity</a>’
            in the LIDO Terminology Recommendation.</p>
            </blockquote>
            <h3 data-number="5.4.11" id="pref"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.4.11</span> <span
            class="citation" data-cites="pref">@pref</span></h3>
            <p><strong>Attribute name:</strong> <a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#pref">lido:pref</a></p>
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> Attribute for text elements like
            &lt;<a
            href="https://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#term">lido:term</a>&gt;
            or appellations, as well as identifier elements, to indicate
            whether, e.g., the value is a preferred or an alternative
            one, or should be used as a search entry only. The <a
            href="http://terminology.lido-schema.org/pref">LIDO
            Preference Vocabulary</a> contains a value list for the pref
            attribute. For concept terms and names of individual
            entities a “<a
            href="http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00169">Preferred
            label</a>” (one and only one per language), always has to be
            provided. If only one value is supplied, this will be chosen
            as the preferred one. To determine how a value should be
            displayed in a portal, the preference role “<a
            href="http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00526">Display
            label</a>” may be used.</p>
            <p><strong>Example:</strong> The following XML code snippet
            represents the concept with indexing terms as defined in the
            SKOS namespace. In order to predefine a label for display,
            the value “Display label” is used for the ‘lido:pref’
            attribute.</p>
            <div class="sourceCode" id="cb55"><pre
            class="sourceCode xml"><code class="sourceCode xml"><span id="cb55-1"><a href="#cb55-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;<span class="kw">lido:roleActor</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb55-2"><a href="#cb55-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>   &lt;<span class="kw">skos:Concept</span></span>
<span id="cb55-3"><a href="#cb55-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">       rdf:about=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300025136&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb55-4"><a href="#cb55-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>       &lt;<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span></span>
<span id="cb